<p style="text-align: center;">Chicken Sunday. 12x12, oil on linen panel. 2014</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Birds continue to be one of my favorite animals to paint: I feel like I have a chance to paint with strong colors and not fuss about the grays.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Most of the painting was done with brushes (background: large bristle, bird: long mongoose flat), but I painted all the greens in with careful strokes of the palette knife.</p>